  "item_short_desc": "<p>Show your solidarity and support for all military personnel serving with our R.E.D. (Remember Everyone Deployed) Long Sleeve T-Shirt. This patriotic shirt features a graphic design on the front chest that honors service members, along with a reverse distressed American Flag on the right sleeve.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133319",
  "description": "<p>Show your solidarity and support for all military personnel serving with our R.E.D. (Remember Everyone Deployed) Long Sleeve T-Shirt. This patriotic shirt features a graphic design on the front chest that honors service members, along with a reverse distressed American Flag on the right sleeve.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>All Day Comfort:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The 60% cotton / 40% polyester blend easily withstands vigorous outdoor use while remaining soft and comfortable. For added durability and convenience, these graphic t-shirts feature reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem, as well as a tag-less label.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Standard Fit:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Remember Everyone Deployed Long Sleeve T-Shirt is designed with a standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for any activity. The crew neck shirt sits approximately at the waist for full coverage and comfort.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Great for Layering:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These long sleeve shirts are perfect for either wearing on their own or as a base layer undershirt. They fit comfortably underneath vests, jackets, and coats, while also looking good when paired with our Spec Ops Tactical Fleece Jacket or MA-1 Flight Jacket.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Land of the Free:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Whether you&rsquo;re out on a weekend trip or casually walking around town, these comfortable shirts are great for outdoor adventures, everyday use, and more. Our R.E.D. Long Sleeve T-Shirts are perfect for showcasing your American spirit during Memorial Day, Veterans Day, and Red Fridays.</li>\n</ul>",
